{
  "duration": 104.26,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Fast software feels different.",
      "start": 0.84,
      "end": 2.82,
      "words": [
        0.84,
        1.36,
        1.88,
        2.24,
        2.82
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Not just better \u2014 actually different, like a different category of experience.",
      "start": 3.28,
      "end": 7.5,
      "words": [
        3.28,
        3.56,
        3.78,
        4.54,
        4.94,
        5.64,
        5.84,
        6.0,
        6.2,
        6.74,
        6.98,
        7.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a threshold somewhere around 100ms where software stops feeling like it's responding to you and starts feeling like it's part of you.",
      "start": 8.36,
      "end": 15.14,
      "words": [
        8.36,
        8.62,
        8.74,
        9.02,
        9.44,
        9.8,
        10.2,
        10.66,
        11.0,
        11.44,
        11.78,
        12.2,
        12.44,
        12.64,
        13.04,
        13.28,
        13.5,
        13.64,
        13.88,
        14.22,
        14.44,
        14.6,
        14.82,
        14.96,
        15.14
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Below that threshold, the interface disappears.",
      "start": 15.66,
      "end": 17.8,
      "words": [
        15.66,
        15.84,
        16.04,
        16.84,
        16.98,
        17.34,
        17.8
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Above it, you're always waiting \u2014 a little, just enough to remind you that the computer is doing something and you are not.",
      "start": 18.52,
      "end": 24.34,
      "words": [
        18.52,
        18.74,
        19.16,
        19.32,
        19.58,
        20.2,
        20.3,
        21.0,
        21.22,
        21.48,
        21.62,
        21.88,
        22.04,
        22.18,
        22.26,
        22.56,
        23.08,
        23.26,
        23.56,
        23.82,
        24.0,
        24.12,
        24.34
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The tax on thought",
      "start": 25.48,
      "end": 26.68,
      "words": [
        25.48,
        25.86,
        26.12,
        26.36,
        26.68
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Latency is a tax on thought.",
      "start": 27.26,
      "end": 28.94,
      "words": [
        27.26,
        27.78,
        28.02,
        28.2,
        28.38,
        28.62,
        28.94
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every time you wait for a response, your train of thought has the opportunity to derail.",
      "start": 29.38,
      "end": 33.46,
      "words": [
        29.38,
        29.52,
        29.72,
        29.86,
        30.06,
        30.24,
        30.34,
        31.04,
        31.14,
        31.48,
        31.58,
        31.82,
        32.06,
        32.22,
        32.74,
        33.06,
        33.46
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You're reminded that you're using a tool, that the tool is separate from you, that this whole thing is mediated.",
      "start": 34.06,
      "end": 39.1,
      "words": [
        34.06,
        34.28,
        34.64,
        34.96,
        35.12,
        35.36,
        35.52,
        36.0,
        36.1,
        36.22,
        36.48,
        36.72,
        37.02,
        37.24,
        37.76,
        37.9,
        38.06,
        38.26,
        38.48,
        38.62,
        39.1
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best software erases that mediation.",
      "start": 39.88,
      "end": 42.12,
      "words": [
        39.88,
        40.02,
        40.3,
        40.8,
        41.38,
        41.62,
        42.12
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The worst software makes you feel it constantly.",
      "start": 42.74,
      "end": 44.86,
      "words": [
        42.74,
        42.92,
        43.2,
        43.68,
        43.92,
        44.02,
        44.28,
        44.44,
        44.86
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Why fast software is rare",
      "start": 46.24,
      "end": 48.04,
      "words": [
        46.24,
        46.48,
        46.96,
        47.56,
        47.8,
        48.04
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Making software fast requires caring about it at every level of the stack.",
      "start": 48.9,
      "end": 52.9,
      "words": [
        48.9,
        49.24,
        49.7,
        50.04,
        50.58,
        51.04,
        51.32,
        51.48,
        51.66,
        51.98,
        52.26,
        52.48,
        52.6,
        52.9
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The database query, the API call, the render path, the bundle size, the parse time \u2014 all of it.",
      "start": 53.48,
      "end": 59.44,
      "words": [
        53.48,
        53.72,
        54.0,
        54.72,
        54.86,
        55.22,
        55.98,
        56.08,
        56.3,
        56.98,
        57.04,
        57.3,
        58.04,
        58.12,
        58.32,
        58.94,
        59.22,
        59.34,
        59.44
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't outsource this to a framework or a CDO network and call it done.",
      "start": 59.96,
      "end": 63.46,
      "words": [
        59.96,
        60.1,
        60.44,
        60.8,
        61.06,
        61.18,
        61.32,
        61.62,
        61.92,
        62.06,
        62.38,
        62.7,
        62.92,
        63.1,
        63.26,
        63.46
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Most software is slow because making it fast is expensive and the people paying for it don't feel the cost.",
      "start": 64.22,
      "end": 70.0,
      "words": [
        64.22,
        64.54,
        65.0,
        65.22,
        65.58,
        65.96,
        66.3,
        66.46,
        66.72,
        66.94,
        67.34,
        67.74,
        67.86,
        68.1,
        68.4,
        68.64,
        68.78,
        69.12,
        69.42,
        69.58,
        70.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They use the software occasionally, on fast machines, with fast connections.",
      "start": 70.6,
      "end": 74.4,
      "words": [
        70.6,
        70.86,
        71.16,
        71.3,
        71.6,
        72.24,
        72.66,
        72.96,
        73.32,
        73.64,
        73.94,
        74.4
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The user feels the slowness; the builder rarely does.",
      "start": 75.08,
      "end": 77.86,
      "words": [
        75.08,
        75.26,
        75.5,
        75.84,
        76.04,
        76.5,
        76.86,
        77.12,
        77.48,
        77.86
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Static sites",
      "start": 78.72,
      "end": 79.42,
      "words": [
        78.72,
        79.06,
        79.42
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the reasons I like static sites is that they're fast by default.",
      "start": 80.04,
      "end": 83.12,
      "words": [
        80.04,
        80.24,
        80.36,
        80.46,
        80.72,
        80.94,
        81.08,
        81.36,
        81.7,
        81.94,
        82.08,
        82.22,
        82.52,
        82.72,
        83.12
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no database query, no server render, no API call between the user and the content.",
      "start": 83.64,
      "end": 88.26,
      "words": [
        83.64,
        83.8,
        83.94,
        84.18,
        84.96,
        85.14,
        85.42,
        86.12,
        86.32,
        86.62,
        86.96,
        87.2,
        87.38,
        87.58,
        87.82,
        87.92,
        88.26
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just files.",
      "start": 88.86,
      "end": 89.78,
      "words": [
        88.86,
        89.12,
        89.32,
        89.78
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This site is a static site.",
      "start": 90.48,
      "end": 92.24,
      "words": [
        90.48,
        90.66,
        90.92,
        91.16,
        91.3,
        91.54,
        91.9,
        92.24
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It builds in seconds and loads in milliseconds.",
      "start": 92.64,
      "end": 94.5,
      "words": [
        92.64,
        92.7,
        92.94,
        93.1,
        93.38,
        93.68,
        93.92,
        94.14,
        94.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is not a technical achievement \u2014 it's a consequence of keeping the thing simple.",
      "start": 95.2,
      "end": 99.36,
      "words": [
        95.2,
        95.42,
        95.52,
        95.74,
        95.9,
        96.16,
        97.06,
        97.18,
        97.22,
        97.6,
        97.92,
        98.16,
        98.72,
        98.92,
        99.36
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Simple is fast.",
      "start": 100.12,
      "end": 101.18,
      "words": [
        100.12,
        100.64,
        100.88,
        101.18
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fast is kind.",
      "start": 101.64,
      "end": 102.44,
      "words": [
        101.64,
        101.86,
        102.12,
        102.44
      ]
    }
  ]
}
